        "node_id": "n_1_55155c",
        "thought_text": "Calculate the number of inversions in the array using a more efficient algorithm like merge sort, which has a time complexity of O(n log n). This will accurately determine the minimum number of moves required to sort the array without causing premature exits or other errors.",
